.jekyll-cache/

# Experiments: screenshots and photo exports are not committed. SVGs are (they are source work).
# Site images in images/ and files/ ARE committed, because they are the site.
# To keep one experiment file anyway: git add -f <path>
experiments/**/*.png
experiments/**/*.jpg
experiments/**/*.jpeg
experiments/**/*.gif
experiments/**/*.webp
experiments/**/*.pdf
experiments/**/*.zip
experiments/**/*.parquet

# Claude Code per-machine settings
.claude/settings.local.json
